# cmd.exe treats a lone LF as part of the command line, so a BOM-less LF `.cmd` file
# turns into a cascade of "'mer's' is not recognized" errors instead of a script
# (measured 2026-10-19 on scripts/repro_customer_init.cmd). Pin the batch files to CRLF
# on checkout so a Linux/macOS clone cannot hand a broken .cmd to a user's double-click.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
